me":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seName":"SE: スペルカード発動音","slideTitle":"第2スライド","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"duration":3.5,"title":"シーン 2"},{"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/アリス（困り）.png","seVolume":0.8,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c.003.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"characterName":"操夢","seName":"SE: 決定・衝撃音","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"「確かに、その通りですね…。」僕は、彼女にそう返す。","telop":"「確かに、その通りですね…。」僕は、彼女にそう返す。","id":"B7A5D8A9-BD3B-436F-A93D-F900A30CC992","seStartTimeOffset":2.599999999999998,"slideTitle":"中扉","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/nc232269_バー.jpg","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg"},{"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/アリス（困り）.png","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c.004.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.456077097505668,"showTelopOverlay":false,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_004_操夢.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 4","telop":"僕たちが、そんな話をしていると、注文したファーストドリンクがやってくる。彼女は、白ワインで、僕は〇〇〇〇を頼んだ。\n制作ソフト及び協力\nGemini\nTohoStuido","id":"D42E1C1B-1B93-4D22-AADA-11FAEA4AAE41","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第4スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/nc2