te_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/影あり困り.png","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c.060.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.322380952380953,"showTelopOverlay":false,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_060_操夢.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 60","telop":"「そうですか…。とりあえず、彼女が戻るのを待ちますか…」\n僕たちは、不安を抱えながら、フランが戻るのを待った。","id":"3EB4A674-A134-4E43-ADEE-5D404DC3BE1A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第60スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/image78.jpeg","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg"},{"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/怒る.png","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c.061.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.709183673469388,"showTelopOverlay":false,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97","characterName":"古明地こいし","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_061_古明地こいし.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 61","telop":"学園の体育科担当教員\n主人公の彼が通っている学園の体育科を担当する教員。鬼教師。第4話でエンドレスランを突如開催した張本人。また、第5話では、紅夢とこいしが過去最低の記録を出したことに対しての説教を朝っぱらから実施した。第13話では、彼を呼び出し、さまざまな体力テストを受けさせた。\n伊吹萃香","id":"C565BE11-010D-42D8-8EB3-F20794E1D6CC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第61スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/image78.jpeg","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg"},{"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/影あり困り.png","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c.062.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.8082539682539682,"showTelopOverlay":false,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_062_操夢.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 62","telop":"僕たちがそれから、数十分ほど待っていると、フランが部屋の扉を再び開き、戻ってきた。そして、あることを告げる。","id":"FEA30A48-1ED8-4CE3-B950-34CFB77B6A6F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第62スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/image78.jpeg","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg"},{"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/影あり困り.png","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c.063.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.291995464852608,"showTelopOverlay":false,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_063_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 63","telop":"「今、お姉様が、こいしさんの両親と協議して、一時的に私たちたちの家で、こいしさんを預かることにしたって連絡が来た。」","id":"E6BFD4B6-10BD-4E84-99BC-3DA9301DA8E8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第63スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/image78.jpeg","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg"},{"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/影あり困り.png","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c.064.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.809342403628118,"showTelopOverlay":false,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_064_操夢.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 64","telop":"「それで、彼女の両親はなんと言ってましたか？」","id":"BAD28284-2AD4-4183-B32A-5C517DC3EAC1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第64スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/image78.jpeg","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg"},{"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/影あり困り.png","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c.065.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.234489795918367,"showTelopOverlay":false,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_065_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 65","telop":"「今、地下底国グループで派閥争いが起きていて、とてもじゃないけど彼女を家に帰らせるわけにはいかないって。」","id":"1FD15537-903B-40B6-B7A9-D242391A9B4E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第65スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/image78.jpeg","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg"},{"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/影あり困り.png","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c\/元女子校の日常　第24話_491cf8c59c.066.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.780748299319728,"showTelopOverlay":false,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_066_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 66","telop":"「それと、こないだの突如の発表は、一旦無効にして、状況が落ち着くまで、私やお姉様と協力するって言ってた。」","id":"64F8B0A3-C7CB-48A5-A43B-A969B0FD5DE5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第66スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/image78.jpeg","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg"},{"animationName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第24話\/影あり困り.png","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideImagePath":"\/Vo